<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:53:39 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>科学家对失眠症患者进行了调查。健康风险模式出现</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-investigated-people-with-insomnia-a-health-risk-pattern-emerged</link><description>研究人员发现，在涉及超过 130 万名参与者的多项研究中，失眠患者中风的风险要高出 26%。他们还发现，这些人因任何入院原因住院的可能性要高出 28%。与失眠相关的其他病症包括痴呆、抑郁和自杀行为。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-investigated-people-with-insomnia-a-health-risk-pattern-emerged.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:53:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-investigated-people-with-insomnia-a-health-risk-pattern-emerged</guid></item><item><title>由于相对论效应，超重元素化合物显示出弱于预期的键</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/superheavy-element-compound-reveals-weaker-than-expected-bond-due-to-relativistic-effects</link><description>由德国达姆施塔特 GSI/FAIR 的一个研究小组领导的国际合作首次测量了超重元素化合物的化学稳定性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/superheavy-element-compound-reveals-weaker-than-expected-bond-due-to-relativistic-effects.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:38:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/superheavy-element-compound-reveals-weaker-than-expected-bond-due-to-relativistic-effects</guid></item><item><title>乔纳·萨克斯谈赢得故事战争：讲故事是我们被忽视的秘密武器</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/jonah-sachs-on-winning-the-story-wars-storytelling-is-our-neglected-secret-weapon</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:23:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/jonah-sachs-on-winning-the-story-wars-storytelling-is-our-neglected-secret-weapon</guid></item><item><title>浅谈平台型生物科技公司的经营策略</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/on-the-business-strategies-of-platform-biotech-companies</link><description>与单一资产生物技术公司相比，平台生物技术公司面临着不同的战略格局。这是我关于平台生物技术业务方法基础知识的简短教育文章。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/on-the-business-strategies-of-platform-biotech-companies.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:08:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/on-the-business-strategies-of-platform-biotech-companies</guid></item><item><title>Robotok：挖掘互联网视频以实现灵巧的机器人学习</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/robotok-mining-internet-videos-for-dexterous-robot-learning</link><description>教机器人操纵物体具有挑战性，因为收集训练数据既昂贵又耗时，并且难以在不同的任务和环境中扩展。另一方面，人类在网上上传的视频中展示了无数的日常技能。挑战在于找到可以帮助机器人学习如何执行特定动作的正确演示。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:53:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/robotok-mining-internet-videos-for-dexterous-robot-learning</guid></item><item><title>“垃圾的定义是什么？”：京都农民用用过的咖啡渣种植蘑菇</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/what-defines-garbage-kyoto-farmer-grows-mushrooms-from-used-coffee-grounds</link><description>京都——京都的一位农民正在用从城市酒店和餐馆收集的用过的咖啡渣种植蘑菇，将废弃的废物转化为垃圾。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/what-defines-garbage-kyoto-farmer-grows-mushrooms-from-used-coffee-grounds.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:38:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/what-defines-garbage-kyoto-farmer-grows-mushrooms-from-used-coffee-grounds</guid></item><item><title>天文学家检测到来自真空的神秘信号。没有人知道它是什么</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/astronomers-have-detected-a-mysterious-signal-coming-from-empty-space-nobody-knows-what-it-is</link><description>在天炉座南部，有一小片天空，就像其他天空一样。你的眼睛可能已经不假思索地与它擦肩而过一百次了。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/astronomers-have-detected-a-mysterious-signal-coming-from-empty-space-nobody-knows-what-it-is.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:23:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/astronomers-have-detected-a-mysterious-signal-coming-from-empty-space-nobody-knows-what-it-is</guid></item><item><title>研究表明，常见的白血病突变会破坏细胞分裂过程中的蛋白质定位</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/common-leukemia-mutation-derails-protein-positioning-during-cell-division-study-reveals</link><description>诺丁汉大学的专家发现了一种常见的基因突变如何扰乱细胞分裂过程中关键蛋白质的定位，揭示了急性髓系白血病背后的新机制以及未来治疗的潜在途径。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/common-leukemia-mutation-derails-protein-positioning-during-cell-division-study-reveals2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:08:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/common-leukemia-mutation-derails-protein-positioning-during-cell-division-study-reveals</guid></item><item><title>Linus Torvalds 表示人工智能是编码的入门药物</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/linus-torvalds-says-ai-is-a-gateway-drug-for-coding</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:53:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/linus-torvalds-says-ai-is-a-gateway-drug-for-coding</guid></item><item><title>我测试了人工智能克隆……它比你想象的更糟糕！</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/i-tested-ai-cloning-and-its-way-worse-than-you-think</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:38:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/i-tested-ai-cloning-and-its-way-worse-than-you-think</guid></item></channel></rss>